{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Scraps - Hellmouth Creek</i> is the first installment in a cozy horror scrapbooking series. Ride bicycles, float down rivers, and explore forest paths while capturing photos that become part of your scrapbook. Each photo you take grows into a record of your trip, filled with discoveries, customization, and hidden surprises.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bike, float, and explore</strong> \u2013 Move through forests, rivers, and winding country trails </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Capture moments</strong> \u2013 Take photos at key spots and preserve your journey with a collection of snapshots</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Create your pages</strong> \u2013 Arrange photos, add stickers, and design a scrapbook page that reflect your personal style</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Discover secrets</strong> \u2013 Unlock hidden details by experimenting with photography </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Quests and challenges</strong> \u2013 Complete objectives that guide your scrapbook progress and reward you with new customizations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collect and customize</strong> \u2013 Find stickers, decorations, and page elements that expand your creative options</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wishlist </strong><strong><i>Scraps: Hellmouth Creek</i></strong><strong> today and be among the first to uncover its secrets when the game launches next March.</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3806810?t=1759705337","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3806810?t=1759705337","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806810/2253fc30b437b5c7a2ea6ac62aac91c051a9f3e7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t